{"id": "yang-valid-1-access-trunk-mix", "verdict": "valid", "violated": null, "note": "Baseline mix: one trunk with explicit list + native, one access port up, one access port admin-down (enabled=false).", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "description": "Uplink to core", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "TRUNK", "native-vlan": 10, "trunk-vlans": [10, 30]}}}}, {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/1", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/1", "description": "Desk port", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "ACCESS", "access-vlan": 10}}}}, {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/7", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/7", "description": "Spare desk", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": false}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "ACCESS", "access-vlan": 30}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}, {"vlan-id": 20, "config": {"vlan-id": 20, "name": "Engineering"}}, {"vlan-id": 30, "config": {"vlan-id": 30, "name": "Voice"}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-valid-2-all-by-omission", "verdict": "valid", "violated": null, "note": "Trunk with NO trunk-vlans leaf: per openconfig-vlan's description, unspecified means all VLANs allowed. This is how our state's \"all\" is encoded (see YANG_SLICE.md finding F2).", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "description": "Uplink to core", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "TRUNK", "native-vlan": 1}}}}, {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/2", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/2", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "ACCESS", "access-vlan": 20}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}, {"vlan-id": 20, "config": {"vlan-id": 20, "name": "Engineering"}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-valid-3-unnamed-vlan", "verdict": "valid", "violated": null, "note": "VLAN 40 has no name leaf (name is optional in vlan-config); the access interface omits description (optional).", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/11", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/11", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "ACCESS", "access-vlan": 40}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}, {"vlan-id": 40, "config": {"vlan-id": 40}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-valid-4-two-trunks", "verdict": "valid", "violated": null, "note": "Two trunks with different explicit lists and natives; one admin-down access port.", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/47", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/47", "description": "Uplink to core A", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "TRUNK", "native-vlan": 10, "trunk-vlans": [10, 20]}}}}, {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "description": "Uplink to core B", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "TRUNK", "native-vlan": 30, "trunk-vlans": [20, 30, 40]}}}}, {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/3", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/3", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": false}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "ACCESS", "access-vlan": 10}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}, {"vlan-id": 20, "config": {"vlan-id": 20, "name": "Engineering"}}, {"vlan-id": 30, "config": {"vlan-id": 30, "name": "Voice"}}, {"vlan-id": 40, "config": {"vlan-id": 40, "name": "IoT"}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-invalid-1-vlan-id-range", "verdict": "invalid", "violated": "openconfig-vlan-types typedef vlan-id: type uint16 range 1..4094 — vlan-id 5000 is out of range", "note": "The global VLAN list itself carries the bad id.", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/1", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/1", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "ACCESS", "access-vlan": 10}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}, {"vlan-id": 5000, "config": {"vlan-id": 5000, "name": "Bogus"}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-invalid-2-access-vlan-on-trunk", "verdict": "invalid", "violated": "openconfig-vlan leaf access-vlan: when \"../interface-mode = 'ACCESS'\" — the leaf must not exist on a TRUNK interface", "note": "Exactly the cross-mode storage our internal state uses deliberately (stored-but-inactive parameters): a faithful OC instance cannot carry it. See YANG_SLICE.md finding F1.", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "TRUNK", "native-vlan": 10, "trunk-vlans": [10, 30], "access-vlan": 1}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}, {"vlan-id": 30, "config": {"vlan-id": 30, "name": "Voice"}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-invalid-3-trunk-vlans-on-access", "verdict": "invalid", "violated": "openconfig-vlan leaf-list trunk-vlans: when \"../interface-mode = 'TRUNK'\" — the leaf-list must not exist on an ACCESS interface", "note": "Mirror of invalid-2, in the direction our state model also stores (trunk parameters kept on access ports).", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/9", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/9", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "ACCESS", "access-vlan": 20, "trunk-vlans": [10, 20]}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}, {"vlan-id": 20, "config": {"vlan-id": 20, "name": "Engineering"}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-invalid-4-trunk-member-range", "verdict": "invalid", "violated": "openconfig-vlan leaf-list trunk-vlans union member oc-vlan-types:vlan-id range 1..4094 — member 0 is out of range", "note": "A single bad member invalidates the leaf-list.", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "TRUNK", "native-vlan": 10, "trunk-vlans": [10, 0]}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-invalid-5-enabled-type", "verdict": "invalid", "violated": "openconfig-interfaces leaf config/enabled: type boolean — the string \"yes\" is not a boolean in RFC 7951 JSON encoding", "note": "Type violation, the class free-text emitters produce most.", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/1", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/1", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": "yes"}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "ACCESS", "access-vlan": 10}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-invalid-6-mode-enum", "verdict": "invalid", "violated": "openconfig-vlan-types typedef vlan-mode-type: enumeration {ACCESS, TRUNK} — \"TRUNKING\" is not a member", "note": "Unknown enum value.", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "TRUNKING", "native-vlan": 10}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}]}}}
{"id": "yang-invalid-7-unknown-leaf", "verdict": "invalid", "violated": "openconfig-vlan grouping vlan-switched-config defines exactly {interface-mode, native-vlan, access-vlan, trunk-vlans} — \"port-mode\" is not a node in the schema", "note": "Unknown-node violation: a node the schema does not define at this path.", "instance": {"openconfig-interfaces:interfaces": {"interface": [{"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "config": {"name": "GigabitEthernet1/0/48", "type": "iana-if-type:ethernetCsmacd", "enabled": true}, "openconfig-if-ethernet:ethernet": {"openconfig-vlan:switched-vlan": {"config": {"interface-mode": "TRUNK", "native-vlan": 10, "port-mode": "TRUNK"}}}}]}, "openconfig-vlan:vlans": {"vlan": [{"vlan-id": 10, "config": {"vlan-id": 10, "name": "Users"}}]}}}
